Just to clarify, we're not talking about huge re-constructional changes her=
e
are we?  We're talking about things like xorlo and dotside.  If I have to
re-learn the gismu that I know now and re-understand a new tense system, I
would change my vote.  But as I suspect that what RLPowell is talking about
is nothing so drastic as all that, I'm ok with change.

